x86emu, the real-mode x86 emulator from the X.org server (taken from XLibre,
hw/xfree86/x86emu, xlibre-xserver 25.2.0-641-g79dee7378). Kestrel's changes:
the X86EMU_timeout hook in decode.c and x86emu.h, and shim/ (stand-ins for
the C library headers the files include).

Realmode X86 Emulator Library

